# ---------------- RvR guilds ----------------
@kind guild
@topic rvr
@who *
who has purge? asking for our next fight
assisting the leader works, lets keep at it
anyone up for practice duels?
headcount for rvr, who is on?
bring siege gear, we keep forgetting
@invites ask
who has the best group setup for rvr?
@invites
stealthers, please call what you see in /gu
@needs defending
{enemy} on {keep}, everyone get out there
@needs attacking
we are on {keep}, more bodies welcome
@needs keep_won_recent
we got {keep}! well done everyone
@needs relic_lost_recent
lost {relic}, this is going to sting
@needs relic_won_recent
{relic} is ours, best night in ages
@needs in_frontier
out in the frontier, group up?

# ---------------- Raiding guilds ----------------
@kind guild
@topic raiding
@who *
who has the most rez classes on tonight?
who wants to lead the next raid?
need before greed or dice? lets vote
who is pulling for the raid, same?
everyone set your bind before the raid please
raid advice: stay off the walls
@needs raid_won_recent
we did it, {boss} is down!
@needs raid_wiped_recent
{boss} wiped us, regroup and think it over
@needs df_ours
@about place
@invites ask_who
we hold darkness falls, who needs seals?
@invites

